  title: Career Path
  kind: 3
  subtitle: Experience & education
  body: "<b>Game development</b>\n2025-2026  Shenkar: 5 games in Unity / C#, a Global Game Jam game in 48 hours, and two solo projects (a 2D platformer and a 3D game with a Blender-rigged hero)\n\n<b>Design & making</b>\n2017-2024  Babilanur, my own brand of touch-controlled lighting objects\n2023-2024  Umasqu, product & electronics developer: PCB design, technical files, FCC/CE certification\n2023-2025  Interactive installations: \"Simon\" for monday.com, \"Point of Light\"\n2022-2023  Tel Aviv Museum of Art: props for Erwin Wurm's \"Narrow House\", lighting for the Miniature Rooms\n\n<b>Camera & production</b>\n2024-2026  Cinema camera technician, Diff-e-rent\n2021-2023  Cinema camera technician, Fitussi Camera Services\n2016-2020  Production equipment coordinator, Movie Mobile\n\n<b>Education</b>\n2025-2026  Game Development, Shenkar (highest honors)\n2021-2022  Design Terminal designers' incubator, Bat Yam\n2008-2011  Film & Television Technician Diploma, Sapir College"
  image: {fileID: 0}
